{{!
    @template local_coursegen/courseai_space_choice_modal_body

    The body of the modal where the teacher adds an activity in a space of the template: one of the activities the
    admin allowed there, and what the teacher asks for it (optional). The AI writes it when the course is generated.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-option" on each radio (value: the module name).
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-instruction" on the teacher's instruction.
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-own-group" around it, and "space-choice-upload" (with its
      "space-choice-upload-button" and "space-choice-filename") on what shows instead when the option is a File the
      teacher uploads: the upload of the file, right in the modal.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * uniqid string - Unique id of this render.
    * options array - Each: modname string, title string, name string (the admin's, may be empty), uploads bool (a File
      the teacher uploads), iconhtml string (core markup), instruction string (the admin's), checked bool.
    * instruction string - What the teacher wrote before; may be empty.
    * hasfile bool, filename string - The file the teacher uploaded before, when there is one.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "options": [{"modname": "quiz", "title": "Quiz", "name": "", "uploads": false, "iconhtml": "",
            "instruction": "Ten questions", "checked": true}],
        "instruction": "",
        "hasfile": false,
        "filename": ""
    }
}}
<fieldset class="mb-3">
    <legend class="h6">{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_which, local_coursegen {{/str}}</legend>
    {{#options}}
    <div class="form-check py-1">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="{{uniqid}}-choice" id="{{uniqid}}-{{modname}}" value="{{modname}}"
               data-uploads="{{#uploads}}1{{/uploads}}{{^uploads}}0{{/uploads}}"
               data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-option"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
        {{! The icon is markup built by Moodle core (image_icon), printed with triple braces as core does. }}
        <label class="form-check-label" for="{{uniqid}}-{{modname}}">
            <span class="d-flex align-items-center"><span class="mr-2">{{{iconhtml}}}</span><strong>{{title}}</strong>{{#name}}<span class="ml-1">· {{name}}</span>{{/name}}</span>
            {{#uploads}}<span class="d-block text-muted small">{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_upload_option, local_coursegen {{/str}}</span>{{/uploads}}
            {{^uploads}}{{#instruction}}<span class="d-block text-muted small">{{instruction}}</span>{{/instruction}}{{/uploads}}
        </label>
    </div>
    {{/options}}
</fieldset>
<div class="form-group mb-0" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-upload" hidden>
    <span class="d-block mb-1">{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_file_label, local_coursegen {{/str}}</span>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mr-3" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-upload-button"
                data-label-upload="{{#str}} courseai_template_space_upload, local_coursegen {{/str}}"
                data-label-replace="{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_file_replace, local_coursegen {{/str}}">{{#hasfile}}{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_file_replace, local_coursegen {{/str}}{{/hasfile}}{{^hasfile}}{{#str}} courseai_template_space_upload, local_coursegen {{/str}}{{/hasfile}}</button>
        <span class="text-muted" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-filename"
              data-empty="{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_file_none, local_coursegen {{/str}}">{{#hasfile}}{{filename}}{{/hasfile}}{{^hasfile}}{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_file_none, local_coursegen {{/str}}{{/hasfile}}</span>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="form-group mb-0" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-own-group">
    <label for="{{uniqid}}-own">{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_own, local_coursegen {{/str}}</label>
    <textarea class="form-control" id="{{uniqid}}-own" rows="3" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-choice-instruction"
              placeholder="{{#str}} courseai_template_choice_space_own_placeholder, local_coursegen {{/str}}">{{instruction}}</textarea>
</div>
